<control id="u1d1b319f-1002" class="AppControlSection"><graphic language=""><text text="The Cisco ASR 1002-HX Router offers embedded services for large enterprise branch offices and high performance private WAN in a 2-rack unit (2RU) form factor. It is integrated with a route processor (RP) and embedded services processor (ESP). Running on Cisco IOS XE Software, the Cisco ASR 1002-HX supports software redundancy without redundant hardware." html="html"><![CDATA[The Cisco ASR 1002-HX Router offers embedded services for large enterprise branch offices and high performance private WAN in a 2-rack unit (2RU) form factor. It is integrated with a route processor (RP) and embedded services processor (ESP). Running on Cisco IOS XE Software, the Cisco ASR 1002-HX supports software redundancy without redundant hardware.]]></text><field name="section" value="Product Overview"/></graphic>
</control>
